//【童心】
<voice name='童心' class='童心' src='voice/md04/0420040a09'>
//「城内にかの銀星号が現れたのでござる。
//　殺戮を繰り広げるのみならず、如何なる力
//でか兵どもを狂乱させておる様子……」
"Ginseigo. The demon itself has appeared. Already it has slaughtered many of our men, or driven them mad. I know not how."

pt:
//【童心】
<voice name='童心' class='童心' src='voice/md04/0420040a09'>
