<voice name='童心' class='童心' src='voice/md04/0420060a09'>
//「武者衆が立ち向かっておるものの……歯が
//立たぬようでござるな。
//　城内の指揮系統は崩壊し、既に軍の体裁を
//失っていると申さねばなりますまい」
"Our musha are presently engaging the beast, but the effort is likely futile. Our forces are in complete disarray. Only a handful of units are still responding to orders."

//【童心】
<voice name='童心' class='童心' src='voice/md04/0420070a09'>
//「また上空では銀星号出現に呼応したごとく、
//零零式が暴走状態に陥ったとのこと。
//　航空戦力も壊滅を目前としており申す」
"To make matters worse, Ginseigo's arrival seems to have triggered something in the new Zeros. They've gone quite berserk, it seems. It's only a matter of time before our remaining air forces are destroyed."

